{"id":"event_fullfoolday_06","cat":"event","group":{"id":"ev130001","label":"Fullfoolday"},"label":"Unicorns Are Real","stage":null,"prev":"event_fullfoolday_05","next":"event_fullfoolday_07","speakers":{"shifty":"Shifty"},"icons":{"shifty":"si_c907_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"event_fullfoolday_06_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_fullfoolday_06_1","text":"Phew... I think that should do it, don't you?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"CityForest_001","bgArt":"cityforest_001","image":null,"bgm":"bgm_story_orangepop","movie":null,"shown":["shifty_s"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_fullfoolday_06_2","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_fullfoolday_06_2","text":"Considering the fact we wiped them all out, I'd say yes.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_fullfoolday_06_3","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_fullfoolday_06_3","text":"I didn't even do anything either. It was all you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_fullfoolday_06_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_fullfoolday_06_4","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_fullfoolday_06_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_fullfoolday_06_5","text":"You can be honest with me, Commander. I already figured it out a long time ago.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_fullfoolday_06_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_fullfoolday_06_6","text":"You and the Deputy Chief planned all of this, didn't you?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_fullfoolday_06_7","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_fullfoolday_06_7","text":"... Huh?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_fullfoolday_06_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_fullfoolday_06_8","text":"A little while ago, I had a counseling session.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_fullfoolday_06_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_fullfoolday_06_9","text":"I'd been feeling a bit morose for a while.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_fullfoolday_06_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_fullfoolday_06_10","text":"I wasn't sure if I was contributing anything in our fight to reclaim the surface.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_fullfoolday_06_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_fullfoolday_06_11","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_fullfoolday_06_12","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_fullfoolday_06_12","text":"Shifty faces me and bows to show her appreciation.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_fullfoolday_06_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_fullfoolday_06_13","text":"Thank you, Commander.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":["shifty_s"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_fullfoolday_06_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_fullfoolday_06_14","text":"I appreciate all the trouble you went through to prepare this environment and these Raptures for me.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_fullfoolday_06_15","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_fullfoolday_06_15","text":"Uh...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_fullfoolday_06_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_fullfoolday_06_16","text":"I'm an operator. I know better than anyone how absurd the notion of taking down so many Raptures with such a small firearm is.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_fullfoolday_06_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_fullfoolday_06_17","text":"Have the Counters been helping me from the sidelines? Or some other Nikkes perhaps?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_fullfoolday_06_18","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_fullfoolday_06_18","text":"No, that isn't...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_fullfoolday_06_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_fullfoolday_06_19","text":"Regardless, I'm thankful for what you've done. I feel a lot better now.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_fullfoolday_06_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_fullfoolday_06_20","text":"I'm much more confident in myself and my work.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_fullfoolday_06_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_fullfoolday_06_21","text":"All of these positive things I'm feeling... I'll try and remember them when I return to work.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_fullfoolday_06_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"shifty","key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_fullfoolday_06_22","text":"Once again, thank you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_fullfoolday_06_23","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_fullfoolday_06_23","text":"Before I can say anything, Shifty says goodbye and leaves...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_fullfoolday_06_24","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_fullfoolday_06_24","text":"*Bang! Bang! Bang*","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_fullfoolday_06_25","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_fullfoolday_06_25","text":"... casually blowing more Raptures to smithereens as she does.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_fullfoolday_06_26","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_fullfoolday_06_26","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_fullfoolday_06_27","type":"Monologue","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:event_fullfoolday_06_27","text":"I think I'll be more than safe following Shifty back to the Outpost.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null}]}